Z||000007||Sage||11-14-2001||03:14 PM||||The "official elbow test" as I saw it demonstrated, consists of;<P>A female appiicant stands 3' from a wall, then is instructed to clasp her hands behind her head, elbows pointing forward.  Then they are told to walk to the wall and stop when any part of the body touches the wall.  If the elbows touch first, they don't get the job.<P>Sadly enough, there are some personnel managers that actually use tactics like this to screen potential employees, even if it is just "looking".  I guess in the case of Hooters, it is appropriate!<P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
